$$
\binom{16}{8} = \frac{16!}{8!8!} = 12870
$$

$$
\binom{8}{4} = \frac{8!}{4!4!} = 70
$$

So:

$$
\text{Number of such paths} = 12870 \cdot 70 \cdot 70 = 12870 \cdot 4900 = 63183000
$$

