c - a - b = \frac{1}{4} \Rightarrow c - \left(-\frac{7}{24}\right) - \left(-\frac{3}{8}\right) = \frac{1}{4} \Rightarrow c + \frac{7}{24} + \frac{3}{8} = \frac{1}{4}
